    "section": "3.88",
    "heading": "Level 3: Druid Subclass",
    "lineStart": 2894,
    "lineEnd": 2896
  },
  "section": "3.88",
  "rulesText": "You gain a Druid subclass of your choice. The Circle of the Land subclass is detailed after this class's description. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Druid levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass's features that are of your Druid level or lower."
}
